Thank you.

57
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:25,000
I think that anyone that needs their car for work and uses it during work hours should be given priority at the sales team.

58
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:36,000
What happens if one of them is off sick? Sue, can we just decide on the priority spaces first? Well, I can think of about four people on the sales team that use their cars regularly.

59
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:39,000
I'll get back to you after the meeting, but I'm pretty sure it's four.

60
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Well, that should leave enough space for management, provided, that is, that Jason gives up the tractor.

61
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,000
How about two car parking spaces for visitors as well? Respective clients might need their spaces.

62
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
