As it's a difficult area to park with a two-hour restriction and client meetings are always running over, that would leave us with two spaces left to be allocated.

70
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Have I got a space? Rita, Rita, client meetings shouldn't be running over two hours.

71
