85
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,000
And if no-one's listening, I'll send it.

86
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:10,000
I also think that if anybody parks inconsiderately, that they should lose their car parking privilege.

87
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Oh.

88
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:19,000
What does everyone think about that? Lucy? What do you think? Yeah, he's right.

89
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,000
OK.

90
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,000
That settles that.

91
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:26,000
