201
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:46,000
Yeah, the people are leaving plates and aren't washing up their plates in the kitchen.

202
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Well, it is, it's an issue. It stinks.

203
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,000
On the same note, actually, the shower room recently.

204
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:55,000
